### Grupos e integrantes visibles (200; Supervisor y Colaborador ven solo sus grupos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/getGroups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Crear un grupo con integrantes; entran con el perfil de su rol de Jobs (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/createGroup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "Cuadrilla norte",
  "userIds": [3096, 3098]
}

### Nombre repetido → 400 GROUP_NAME_EXISTS
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/createGroup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "Cuadrilla norte"
}

### Agregar personas con el perfil de su rol (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/addUsersToGroup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 120,
  "userIds": [3099]
}

### Colaborador como Supervisor del grupo → 400 PROFILE_NOT_ALLOWED_FOR_ROLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/addUsersToGroup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 120,
  "userIds": [3099],
  "profileId": 2
}

### Persona no visible → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/addUsersToGroup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 120,
  "userIds": [1]
}

### Propietario del grupo hace Supervisor a un Supervisor de Jobs (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/setGroupUserProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 120,
  "targetUserId": 3098,
  "profileId": 2
}

### Quitarle el perfil Propietario al único Propietario del grupo → 400 GROUP_LAST_OWNER
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/setGroupUserProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 120,
  "targetUserId": {{myUserId}},
  "profileId": 2
}

### Supervisor del grupo intenta cambiar perfiles → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/setGroupUserProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 120,
  "targetUserId": 3099,
  "profileId": 3
}
